    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Strategy RPG and DeckBuilder based around the game of American Football.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494490/extras/c0de6a672e819f3fbf178fd4db4c5438.poster.avif?t=1739107110\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494490/extras/c0de6a672e819f3fbf178fd4db4c5438.webm?t=1739107110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494490/extras/c0de6a672e819f3fbf178fd4db4c5438.mp4?t=1739107110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own custom Team with a custom Color Scheme, Name, and Region.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your Players stats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494490/extras/29d7d350753a352e6d2f690d71212c57.avif?t=1739107110\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve the Playbook with Deckbuilding mechanics and synergies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494490/extras/33eb2f798d55cd644783bc5b3b70db69.poster.avif?t=1739107110\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494490/extras/33eb2f798d55cd644783bc5b3b70db69.webm?t=1739107110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494490/extras/33eb2f798d55cd644783bc5b3b70db69.mp4?t=1739107110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494490/extras/c741cbcb9a67ff59af613513692357cd.avif?t=1739107110\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face Off Against Difficult Opponents on your way to a Championship!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494490/extras/4e44a8724ed238bf1bc11fcc1050f08d.poster.avif?t=1739107110\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494490/extras/4e44a8724ed238bf1bc11fcc1050f08d.webm?t=1739107110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494490/extras/4e44a8724ed238bf1bc11fcc1050f08d.mp4?t=1739107110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Strategy RPG and DeckBuilder based around the game of American Football.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494490/extras/c0de6a672e819f3fbf178fd4db4c5438.poster.avif?t=1739107110\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494490/extras/c0de6a672e819f3fbf178fd4db4c5438.webm?t=1739107110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494490/extras/c0de6a672e819f3fbf178fd4db4c5438.mp4?t=1739107110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own custom Team with a custom Color Scheme, Name, and Region.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your Players stats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494490/extras/29d7d350753a352e6d2f690d71212c57.avif?t=1739107110\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve the Playbook with Deckbuilding mechanics and synergies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494490/extras/33eb2f798d55cd644783bc5b3b70db69.poster.avif?t=1739107110\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494490/extras/33eb2f798d55cd644783bc5b3b70db69.webm?t=1739107110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494490/extras/33eb2f798d55cd644783bc5b3b70db69.mp4?t=1739107110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\">